{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"反圍標新措施一片詳解\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APP-BID-261031.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】隨著宏福苑獨立委員會報告公布，港府推行一系列針對圍標問題的改革措施，但究竟這些措施如何實行？怎樣發揮作用？一般市民不容易全面理解。就此，有網民製作影片，用圖像解說，助公眾整合、理解，本台轉載有關影片，供大家參考。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:39.044731+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T05:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.798308+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:28.091134+00:00","content_hash":"aff3d0ee0ac3a002cc79a58dad9571b3900ad0bb6bddf6734a2d6d1c8ddfae02","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:39.044731+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}